{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分法", "复合函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$-\\dfrac{\\ln 3}{1+3^x}\\,dx$", "explanation": "由链式法则，\n\n$$\ny'=\\frac{1}{1+3^{-x}}\\cdot(-\\ln3)3^{-x}=-\\frac{\\ln3}{1+3^x}.\n$$\n\n故 $dy=-\\dfrac{\\ln3}{1+3^x}dx$。", "methods": ["链式法则"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["凹凸性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$\\left(-\\infty,-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)\\cup\\left(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}},+\\infty\\right)$", "explanation": "有\n\n$$\ny'=-2xe^{-x^2},\\qquad y''=(4x^2-2)e^{-x^2}=2(2x^2-1)e^{-x^2}.\n$$\n\n因为 $e^{-x^2}>0$，故当 $|x|>\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$ 时 $y''>0$，曲线为上凸。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["广义积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$1$", "explanation": "分部积分，取 $u=\\ln x$，$dv=x^{-2}dx$，则\n\n$$\n\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\ln x}{x^2}dx=\\left.-\\frac{\\ln x}{x}\\right|_1^{+\\infty}+\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^2}=1.\n$$", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "所求路程为\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\sqrt{\\pi/2}}^{\\sqrt{\\pi}}t\\sin(t^2)dt.\n$$\n\n令 $u=t^2$，则 $du=2t\\,dt$，故原积分等于\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{\\pi/2}^{\\pi}\\sin u\\,du=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$-1$", "explanation": "分子分母同时乘以 $e^{-1/x}$，得\n\n$$\n\\frac{e^{-1/x}-1}{xe^{-1/x}+1}.\n$$\n\n当 $x\\to0^+$ 时，$e^{-1/x}\\to0$，故极限为 $\\dfrac{-1}{1}=-1$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["曲线相切"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "切点在两曲线上，先代入 $x=1,y=-1$ 得 $1+a+b=-1$，即 $a+b=-2$。又两曲线在该点斜率相等：前者斜率 $2x+a$ 在点处为 $2+a$；后者由隐函数求导得在点处斜率为 $1$，故 $2+a=1$，即 $a=-1$，从而 $b=-1$。", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["分段函数", "积分上限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "当 $0\\le x\\le1$ 时直接积分得 $F(x)=\\dfrac{x^3}{3}$。当 $1<x\\le2$ 时，\n\n$$\nF(x)=\\int_0^1t^2dt+\\int_1^x(2-t)dt=\\frac{1}{3}+2x-\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}=-\\frac{7}{6}+2x-\\frac{x^2}{2}.\n$$\n\n故选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "极大值只是局部性质，A 与 D 都不一定成立。把图像关于原点作中心对称，相当于考察 $y=-f(-x)$，于是 $x_0$ 的极大值点对应为 $-x_0$ 的极小值点，故选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["渐近线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "当 $x\\to0$ 时分母趋于 $0$ 而分子趋于 $2$，所以 $x=0$ 是铅直渐近线；当 $x\\to\\pm\\infty$ 时 $e^{-x^2}\\to0$，故 $y\\to1$，所以 $y=1$ 是水平渐近线。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png", "images/q010_diagram.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "以杆右端为原点，杆位于区间 $[-l,0]$。长度元 $dx$ 的质量为 $\\mu dx$，与质点的距离为 $a-x$，故微元引力为\n\n$$\ndF=\\frac{k m\\mu}{(a-x)^2}dx.\n$$\n\n沿整根细杆积分即可，故选 A。", "methods": ["微元法"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "二阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{t^2+2-2t\\sin t\\cos t}{(\\cos t-t\\sin t)^3}$", "explanation": "先求\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{\\sin t+t\\cos t}{\\cos t-t\\sin t}.\n$$\n\n再对 $t$ 求导并除以 $dx/dt=\\cos t-t\\sin t$，整理得\n\n$$\n\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{t^2+2-2t\\sin t\\cos t}{(\\cos t-t\\sin t)^3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$2\\ln\\dfrac{4}{3}$", "explanation": "令 $t=\\sqrt{x}$，则 $x=t^2,dx=2t\\,dt$，原积分化为\n\n$$\n2\\int_1^2\\frac{dt}{t(1+t)}=2\\int_1^2\\left(\\frac{1}{t}-\\frac{1}{1+t}\\right)dt=2\\ln\\frac{4}{3}.\n$$", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["等价无穷小", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{6}$", "explanation": "当 $x\\to0$ 时，\n\n$$\nx-\\sin x\\sim\\frac{x^3}{6},\\qquad e^x-1\\sim x.\n$$\n\n所以原式\n\n$$\n\\sim\\frac{x^3/6}{x^2\\cdot x}=\\frac{1}{6}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分", "三角积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{x^2}{4}-\\dfrac{x\\sin2x}{4}-\\dfrac{\\cos2x}{8}+C$", "explanation": "用恒等式 $\\sin^2x=\\dfrac{1-\\cos2x}{2}$，则\n\n$$\n\\int x\\sin^2x\\,dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\int x\\,dx-\\frac{1}{2}\\int x\\cos2x\\,dx.\n$$\n\n第二项作分部积分，整理得所求结果。", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["一阶线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$y=\\dfrac{(x-1)e^x+1}{x}$", "explanation": "方程可写成 $(xy)'=xe^x$。积分得\n\n$$\nxy=\\int xe^x dx=(x-1)e^x+C.\n$$\n\n由 $y(1)=1$ 得 $C=1$，故\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{(x-1)e^x+1}{x}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "proof", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数应用", "不等式证明"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "见解析。", "explanation": "令\n\n$$\nf(x)=(1+x)\\ln(1+x)-x\\ln x.\n$$\n\n则命题等价于 $f(x)>0$（$x>1$）。求导得\n\n$$\nf'(x)=\\ln\\frac{1+x}{x}>0,\n$$\n\n所以 $f$ 在 $(1,+\\infty)$ 上递增，而 $f(1)=2\\ln2>0$，故对一切 $x>1$ 都有 $f(x)>0$，命题成立。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$y=C_1\\cos x+C_2\\sin x+x+\\dfrac{1}{2}x\\sin x$", "explanation": "对应齐次方程通解为 $C_1\\cos x+C_2\\sin x$。对右端的 $x$ 可取特解 $y_{p1}=x$；对共振项 $\\cos x$ 取特解 $y_{p2}=Ax\\sin x$，代入得 $A=\\dfrac{1}{2}$。故通解为\n\n$$\ny=C_1\\cos x+C_2\\sin x+x+\\frac{1}{2}x\\sin x.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["旋转体体积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$", "explanation": "区域位于 $x\\in[1,2]$，且曲线在该区间下方。用柱壳法：\n\n$$\nV=2\\pi\\int_1^2x\\bigl(-(x-1)(x-2)\\bigr)dx=2\\pi\\int_1^2(-x^3+3x^2-2x)dx=\\frac{\\pi}{2}.\n$$", "methods": ["柱壳法"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["最值", "导数应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png", "images/q019_diagram.png"], "answer": "$x_B=\\dfrac{\\ln2}{3}-1,\\quad x_C=\\dfrac{1+\\ln2}{3}$", "explanation": "设 $C$ 的横坐标为 $x>0$，则由 $e^{x_B}=2e^{-2x}$ 得 $x_B=\\ln2-2x$。梯形面积可表示为\n\n$$\nS(x)=\\frac{e^{-2x}+2e^{-2x}}2\\,(x-x_B)=\\frac{3}{2}e^{-2x}(3x-\\ln2).\n$$\n\n求导得唯一极大点 $x=\\dfrac{1+\\ln2}{3}$，于是\n\n$$\nx_B=\\ln2-2x=\\frac{\\ln2}{3}-1.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1991", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1991, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["周期递推", "定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1991_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1991_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$\\pi^2-2$", "explanation": "当 $x\\in[\\pi,2\\pi)$ 时，\n\n$$\nf(x)=x-\\pi+\\sin x;\n$$\n\n当 $x\\in[2\\pi,3\\pi)$ 时，再递推一次得 $f(x)=x-2\\pi$。故\n\n$$\n\\int_\\pi^{3\\pi}f(x)dx=\\int_\\pi^{2\\pi}(x-\\pi+\\sin x)dx+\\int_{2\\pi}^{3\\pi}(x-2\\pi)dx=\\pi^2-2.\n$$", "methods": []}
